<LegalLayout title="Community Guidelines">
  <p class="lede">
    Placeholder structure for Pynapli's Community Guidelines. Pynapli is a social lifestyle app for
    open-minded adults — these rules keep it welcoming, honest, and safe.
  </p>

  <h2>Be 18+</h2>
  <p>Everyone here is an adult. No minors, and never content involving minors.</p>

  <h2>Consent &amp; respect</h2>
  <p>Consent is everything. Take “no” gracefully. Treat every member with respect.</p>

  <h2>Be authentic</h2>
  <p>Use real, recent photos of yourself. No impersonation, catfishing, or misleading profiles.</p>

  <h2>Keep public spaces tasteful</h2>
  <p>
    No explicit content in profile photos or other public-facing areas. Private albums are for
    consensual, member-controlled sharing.
  </p>

  <h2>No harassment or hate</h2>
  <p>No harassment, threats, hate speech, or discrimination. No spam or solicitation.</p>

  <h2>No illegal activity</h2>
  <p>Pynapli is not a marketplace for escorting or sex services. Nothing illegal.</p>

  <h2>Safety &amp; reporting</h2>
  <p>
    Report anything that breaks these rules. See the <a href="/safety">Safety Center</a> for tools
    and tips.
  </p>

  <h2>Enforcement</h2>
  <p>Breaking these guidelines can lead to warnings, limits, or removal from Pynapli.</p>
</LegalLayout>
